1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:52,480
Reporting to Grand Elder

25
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:54,040
Elders Pu Lin, Gu Cheng and Kun Sang

26
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:55,960
have requested reinforcements.

27
00:01:58,440 --> 00:02:01,760
Qian Kun
Fighting Evil Sect Grand Elder
Middle stage Core Formation

28
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,450
Grand Elder,

29
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:10,120
should we go ?

30
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:25,720
Our Fighting Evil Sect's territory

31
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:28,440
is not to be messed with.

32
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:49,840
Pu Lin !

33
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:55,520
This isn't a regular Foundation Establishment cultivator.

34
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,280
This guy is about to

35
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:59,040
enter the Core Formation stage !

36
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:02,600
After one day and one night,

37
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:04,880
my flying sword's attacks are no longer as effective.

38
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:07,400
My Ji Realm is only able to injure them

39
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,440
but not kill them.

40
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:12,160
It seems I only have a single card left.

41
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:30,520
Even if the Underworld Ice Flame is strong,

42
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:32,000
it's like a tree without roots.

43
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,560
Using it like this will consume the flame

44
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:36,120
at a very fast pace.

45
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:38,600
I have no choice but to risk it...

46
00:03:45,320 --> 00:03:46,280
Grand Elder !

47
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:49,400
Three more Core Formations have arrived...

48
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:51,440
The leader is at Middle stage Core Formation.

49
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:55,560
Now that reinforcements have arrived

50
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:58,480
I can't risk shattering my Core embryo

51
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:00,040
to kill them anymore.

52
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:01,880
Little brat,

53
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:04,840
you killed an Elder of our Fighting Evil Sect.

54
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:07,720
No matter how far you flee,

55
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:10,040
we will still kill you !

56
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:15,320
I have one last idea.

57
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:17,510
Although it will be dangerous,

58
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:19,240
it will all be over

59
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:20,960
if I succeed.

60
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,640
Faster, I must go faster !

61
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:39,400
It's been 3 years

62
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:42,240
and I still haven't heard from him...

63
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:45,920
Back then, he saved my life.

64
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:48,160
And then he promised

65
00:04:48,840 --> 00:04:50,680
to send me back to the Burning Fire Alliance.

66
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:56,320
I wonder if he will ever come back...

67
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,360
Senior !

68
00:05:16,440 --> 00:05:17,240
Senior...

69
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:19,080
What's wrong ?

70
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:20,200
What happened ?

71
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:28,880
Wu Liu
Fighting Evil Sect Elder
Early stage Core Formation

72
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,040
Little brat,

73
00:05:27,080 --> 00:05:28,880
why did you stop running ?

74
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:44,640
That young woman we just saw

75
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:46,040
Da Tou (Big Head)
Fighting Evil Sect Elder
Early stage Core Formation

76
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:46,160
belongs to me !

77
00:05:46,520 --> 00:05:49,360
It just happened that I needed a cultivation furnace !

78
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:55,840
When did such a formation appear here ?

79
00:05:56,320 --> 00:05:58,240
Since this formation can summon a dragon,

80
00:05:58,240 --> 00:05:59,800
it can't be ordinary...

81
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,240
Kun Sang,

82
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:03,040
try using your Thousand Peaks Seal Stamp.

83
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:41,320
This really is a good formation...
